-- Tests for wra3-pt7-final.l4 (sections 148, 150(3)) and wra3-sch10.l4 (Schedule 10 paragraph 1(2)).
-- Expected values are written from the text (raw lines 2583-2586, 2619, 3360). The appointed day below is INVENTED.

§ `s 148`

#ASSERT `s 148 the sum is to be paid out of money provided by Parliament` `s 148(a) a sum paid by the Secretary of State by way of universal credit or personal independence payment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 148 the sum is to be paid out of money provided by Parliament` `s 148(b) other expenditure incurred in consequence of this Act by a Minister of the Crown or the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 148 the sum is to be paid out of money provided by Parliament` `s 148(c) an increase attributable to this Act in the sums payable under any other Act out of money so provided` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 148 the sum is to be paid out of money provided by Parliament` `s 148 any other sum` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 150(3)`

#ASSERT `s 150(3) the day appointed for the coming into force of the provision` (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST (Date 8 4 2013)
#ASSERT `s 150(3) the day appointed for the coming into force of the provision` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- in force on and after the appointed day (8 April 2013, invented), not before
#ASSERT `s 150(3) the provision is in force on the date` (Date 8 4 2013) (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150(3) the provision is in force on the date` (Date 9 4 2013) (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150(3) the provision is in force on the date` (Date 7 4 2013) (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 150(3) the provision is in force on the date` (Date 7 4 2013) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 10 para 1(2)`

#ASSERT `sch 10 para 1(2) the appointed day` (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST (Date 8 4 2013)
#ASSERT `sch 10 para 1(2) the appointed day` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 10 para 1(2) the date is on or after the appointed day` (Date 8 4 2013) (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 10 para 1(2) the date is on or after the appointed day` (Date 7 4 2013) (JUST (Date 8 4 2013)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 10 para 1(2) the date is on or after the appointed day` (Date 7 4 2013) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
